<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Anchor Wallace PO# {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c} Order on Hold Clarification Required., Order #{!relatedTo.EBS_Order_Number__c}, {!relatedTo.ThreadID_FK__c}"
recipientType="Contact" relatedToType="case">
 <messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<html>
<span><img src="https://kooziegroup--c.documentforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0154w000024rRrQ&oid=00D1U000000oeAl&lastMod=1650037233000" title="Anchor Wallace Logo" /></span><br />


<p>Thanks for ordering from Anchor Wallace Group! Your order is temporarily on hold.</p>

<p><b>We can’t wait to complete your order but need some additional information from you first on the order below:</b></p>
    
   <li> Customer Name: {!relatedTo.Customer_Name__c}</li>
   <li>Customer Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Account_Number__c}</li>
   <li>PO Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}</li>
   <li>Order Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}</li>
 <apex:variable var="idx" value="{!0}"/>

     <apex:repeat var="cx1" value="{!relatedTo.Clarification_Questions__r}">
     <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!if(idx==0,true,false)}">
     <apex:outputpanel rendered="{!if(cx1.ClarAppVersion__c = '3.0',true,false)}">

    <p>All you need to do now is <b>click the link below</b> to respond to any clarifications needed to be able to proceed with your order.</p>  
   <li>Link: <a href="{!relatedTo.Clar_Link__c}"> {!relatedTo.Clar_Link__c}</a> </li>
    </apex:outputpanel>
    </apex:outputpanel>
        <apex:variable var="idx" value="{!idx + 1}" />
    </apex:repeat>
    <br/>
<!--
<p>All you need to do now is <b>click the link below</b> to respond to any clarifications needed to be able to proceed with your order.</p>  
 Go To the Link : <a href="{!relatedTo.EBS_Order__r.Tracking_Link_NoPricing__c}">{!relatedTo.EBS_Order__r.Tracking_Link_No_Pricing__c}</a>
-->

<p>Please be advised that your order is <b><u>ON HOLD</u></b> until you have provided responses to each clarification.</p> 
    
    <li><b>PO Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}</b></li>
    <li><b>Order Number: {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}</b></li>

<!--
<p><b>You must follow the link below to view what is needed to proceed with your order.</b>Please do not reply to this email. Replying to this email will not move your order into production as timely.</p> 
-->

<p>
<apex:repeat var="cx" value="{!relatedTo.Clarification_Questions__r}">

<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!if((cx.Status__c != 'Closed' && cx.Status__c != 'Answered' && cx.Status__c != 'Canceled') && cx.recordtype.name=='ClarificationQuestion' ,true,false)}">
<tr >
 <td>Product Number: &nbsp;{!cx.Product_Number__c}</td><br/>
 <td>Line Number: &nbsp;{!cx.Line_Number__c}</td><br/>
 <td>Message Text: &nbsp;{!cx.Message_Text__c}</td><br/>
 <br/>
</tr>
</apex:outputPanel>
</apex:repeat>
</p>     

<!--
<p><b>If clicking this link results in an error, please copy and paste the address into your internet browser.</b></p>   
-->


<p>All the best, <br/>
The Anchor Wallace Customer Care Crew<br/></p>
<a href="https://www.anchorwallace.com" style="text-decoration:none;color:#456FB2;font-size:18px;font-family:Source Sans Pro Black,sans-serif;">anchorwallace.com</a><br />
<br/>
<span style="font-size:11px"><b><span style="line-height:.7;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE</span></b><br />
<span style="line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">This electronic message is confidential and may contain legally privileged information intended only for the use of the individual
or company named above. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or the employee or agent responsible
to deliver it to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified&nbsp; that any dissemination, distribution or copying of this communication
is strictly prohibited. If you have received this communication in error, please immediately notify us by telephone, and
return the original message to us at the address&nbsp;above.</span> </span>
</html>
 </messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>